HEISS Prompt Studio is a derivative of HEISS UI.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/tristmeister/HEISS-UI

Upstream version used as the baseline:
v0.18.1

Upstream authors and copyright holders:
Leander de Buhr (HEISS UI)
Jasper (J-AI Studio, the project HEISS UI is based on)

Upstream license:
MIT

This derivative preserves the upstream license, copyright notices, model
integration work, server foundation, and visual design. It adds a Chinese UI
layer, local reference gallery integration, local and online prompt libraries,
incremental prompt/image caching, and LocalDock-friendly launch tooling.

HEISS Prompt Studio is not an official HEISS UI release and is not endorsed by
the upstream authors unless explicitly stated by them.
